<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst William Leach cut his 1997 earnings estimate for Kellogg Co to $3.15 a share from $3.20, a source said.</p>
<p>-- The 1998 estimate was cut to $3.45 a share from $3.55.</p>
<p>-- The analyst could not comment on the move.</p>
<p>-- The rating remains underperform.</p>
<p>-- Kellogg shares were up one at 67.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
